      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_tfv1qecca8",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "How your donation helps us keep showing up."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A full year of this work costs $272,120, or $22,677 a month."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "$272,120 a year funds a four-person team, including two additional full-time Peer Specialist / Case Manager positions at $60,000 each. About $150,000 a year sustains BFF at its current staffing level."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Basic needs, $48,920 (18%)"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Stabilization, $147,200 (54%)"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Sustained support, $76,000 (28%)"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 3
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Basic needs"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "$48,920 a year"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "$4,077 a month"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "MealsPurchased food fills the gaps in donated food, so we can serve about 458 meals each month. Donated food added another $24,114 in value in 2024.$10,400 a year"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Personal care suppliesAbout 11,360 hygiene, first-aid and personal care items each year. In-kind gifts keep our average cost to about $0.27 per item.$3,120 a year"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Outreach infrastructureThe staff time and licensed kitchen it takes to source, prepare, haul, set up, serve and clean up two outreach events every week. Volunteers add at least $16,959 in labor.$35,400 a year"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 3
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Stabilization"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "$147,200 a year"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "$12,267 a month"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "RTD bus passesAt least 370 rides a month to appointments, food banks, shelter and services. We buy passes at a 50% nonprofit discount.$6,000 a year"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Laundry vouchersTwenty vouchers a month, so people can reuse clothing, blankets and sleeping bags.$1,200 a year"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Daily peer outreach and resource navigationCurrent resource information and partner relationships, personal navigation, Coordinated Entry and housing assessments, and warm handoffs to providers.$140,000 a year"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 3
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Sustained support"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "$76,000 a year"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "$6,333 a month"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Peer case managementIndividualized support, housing and other advocacy, coordination, problem-solving and follow-through toward goals people set for themselves.$70,000 a year"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Mobile service and direct costsKeeps the team mobile and covers the small costs that remove barriers: IDs, documents, application fees.$6,000 a year"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Volunteer labor is based on about 424 recorded volunteer hours at Tuesday outreach events in 2024, valued at Colorado's current estimated value of volunteer time. Friday hours are not included."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "$500 buys 37 ten-ride RTD pass books, at least 370 rides. Passes are valid for three hours and may include transfers."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
